*.swf
!platforms/**/fixture.swf
wip/*/draft.as
wip/*/scratch/
wip/*/scratch-*/
wip/*/last-try*.pcode
wip/*/target*.pcode
wip/*/ctx.as
calibration/scratch/
reference/strings.json
reference/xrefs-index.json
tests/behaviour/renders/
tools/smoke/
